private diagnostic fixture is distributed as part of this helper.

Rebuilding the helper is a developer operation using JDK 17 and the pinned
Google R8/D8 tool identified by version and SHA-256 in lib/android/manifest.json.
R8/D8 and the JDK are not included in the adapter and are not required on the
ioBroker host to run the supplied helper. Their own distribution terms apply
when developers obtain them; the MIT license above covers the project's own
source, not those build tools or Android SDK Platform Tools.
